WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.486
Meet ADVISIO.

2
00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:15.178
Behind every research project is a
journey of ideas, guidance,

3
00:00:15.305 --> 00:00:17.546
revisions, and important decisions.

4
00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:22.446
Keeping that journey connected is what
ADVISIO is designed to do.

5
00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:30.236
When documents, feedback, schedules,
and approvals are spread across

6
00:00:30.282 --> 00:00:33.881
different places, keeping track of
research becomes harder.

7
00:00:34.787 --> 00:00:38.757
ADVISIO brings these parts of the
process into one connected

8
00:00:38.804 --> 00:00:39.814
workspace.

9
00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:48.665
ADVISIO connects the people,
documents, and academic activities

10
00:00:48.735 --> 00:00:50.000
involved in research.

11
00:00:50.778 --> 00:00:54.459
Each user works through a role-based
workspace, with tools and

12
00:00:54.552 --> 00:00:57.071
access suited to their
responsibilities.

13
00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:07.483
Research coordinators provide the
structure.

14
00:01:07.877 --> 00:01:11.593
They organize research workflows,
define milestones, establish

15
00:01:11.651 --> 00:01:14.867
requirements, and prepare the academic
activities that guide

16
00:01:14.925 --> 00:01:16.678
researchers through each stage.

17
00:01:27.300 --> 00:01:30.098
Researchers follow that structure in
their own workspace.

18
00:01:30.493 --> 00:01:33.941
They can organize their research
group, view milestones, manage

19
00:01:33.987 --> 00:01:37.517
requirements, and track progress as
their study develops.

20
00:01:50.300 --> 00:01:52.494
Advisers become part of the same
journey.

21
00:01:52.947 --> 00:01:56.093
They can accept research groups,
monitor progress, review

22
00:01:56.151 --> 00:01:58.346
manuscripts, and provide feedback.

23
00:01:58.961 --> 00:02:02.595
With version history and recorded
review decisions, improvements

24
00:02:02.653 --> 00:02:05.161
remain connected to the work that came
before.

25
00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:21.432
Beyond documents, ADVISIO supports
conversations, consultations,

26
00:02:21.664 --> 00:02:25.843
schedules, and recorded guidance,
helping researchers and faculty

27
00:02:25.936 --> 00:02:27.724
coordinate their next steps.

28
00:02:32.300 --> 00:02:36.085
As research moves toward defense,
required approvals help establish

29
00:02:36.155 --> 00:02:36.712
readiness.

30
00:02:37.327 --> 00:02:41.402
Coordinators verify eligibility, deans
review formal authorization

31
00:02:41.460 --> 00:02:45.071
requests, and approved groups can
proceed to defense scheduling.

32
00:02:52.300 --> 00:02:56.062
Panelists review the prepared
materials and submit their evaluations

33
00:02:56.108 --> 00:02:57.733
through ADVISIO.

34
00:02:58.407 --> 00:03:01.971
With the required assessments
complete, the authorized coordinator

35
00:03:02.041 --> 00:03:05.628
can review the results and release the
official defense decision.

36
00:03:12.300 --> 00:03:16.514
At the institutional level, ADVISIO
gives authorized academic

37
00:03:16.596 --> 00:03:19.150
leaders visibility into research
activity.

38
00:03:19.719 --> 00:03:23.759
Deans can monitor progress and access
reports, while administrators

39
00:03:23.794 --> 00:03:27.718
support access, configuration, and
system management.

40
00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:33.426
One research journey.

41
00:03:33.693 --> 00:03:36.526
Connected people, processes, and
decisions.

42
00:03:36.886 --> 00:03:38.256
ADVISIO.

43
00:03:38.616 --> 00:03:39.881
Move research forward.

44
00:03:40.241 --> 00:03:41.402
Keep the thread.
